  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "NEW\n\t\t\t* Extensibility: a package can write its own constraint, and state an assertion as a table\n\t\t\t* Extensibility: Build lists the build's projects and their references, and opens debug information by assembly name\n\t\t\t* Extensibility: a package can write a page of its own with SpecificationPage, the tests below it headed by folder and linked to their files\n\t\t\tDEPRECATED\n\t\t\t* Source.Projects with Within and NonRedundant, Segment, DependencyGraph and ArchitectureDocument moved to TSpec.Architecture.CSharp 1.6",
